### 场景1：使用Bloom Filter

### 1.1 用户登录
POST http://localhost:10001/bloomFilter/addBloomFilter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "userFilter",
  "value": ["10086", "10000"]
}

### 1.2 用户是否存在
GET http://localhost:10001/bloomFilter/mightContain/userFilter/10086
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 用户是否存在
GET http://localhost:10001/bloomFilter/mightContain/userFilter/10010
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 布隆过滤器数量
GET http://localhost:10001/bloomFilter/bloomFilterCount/userFilter
Accept: application/json
